### create session

POST {{baseUrl}}/session/create HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{jabir}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "MORNING"
}


### get all sessions

GET {{baseUrl}}/session/all?page=1&limit=20&year=2026&day=2026-04-18&month=2026-04 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{jabir}}


### get weekly sessions

GET {{baseUrl}}/session/weekly HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{jabir}}


### get this week total

GET {{baseUrl}}/session/weekly-count HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{jabir}}


### get analytic stats

GET {{baseUrl}}/session/analytic-stats HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{jabir}}


### get morning vs night stat

GET {{baseUrl}}/session/morning-vs-night HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{jabir}}


### get current streak

GET {{baseUrl}}/session/current-streak HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{jabir}}


### get star count

GET {{baseUrl}}/session/star-count HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{jabir}}
